<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark bond due Sep 2001.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark bond due Sep 2001.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Bayerische Hypothekenbank, BHF Bank, Commerzbank,  DG Bank, and Sal Oppenheim.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK HANNOVER</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON   **4.25	MATURITY  **25.SEP.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.80    PAY DATE    24.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p>NOTES  **STEPS UP TO 4.75 PCT ON 25.SEP.97 IF NOT CALLED AT PAR  </p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 712</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
